# Generated client code lives here. Do not edit by hand.
#
# Regenerate via:
#
#   make generate
#
# This requires npx (Node.js) on PATH so `openapi-generator-cli` can run.
# The wrapper layer (lib/smplkit/*.rb except this directory) is hand-crafted
# and expects the generated client modules under
# +SmplkitGeneratedClient::App+, +::Config+, +::Flags+, and +::Logging+.
#
# The initial Ruby SDK release ships without prebuilt generated clients —
# the wrapper layer talks directly to Faraday until the generator output is
# wired in. See ISSUES.md.
